<title>USA: Dodge City feeder steer prices up $1-$3 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Dodge City feeder steer prices up $1-$3 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers 300-600 lbs were firm to $3.00 per cwt higher, compared with last week, USDA said - Feeder steers 600-950 lbs 1.00-2.00 higher. Feeder heifers 600-850 lbs 2.00-3.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trade was active, with very good deamnd. Receipts 64 percent 600 lbs and over; 31 percent 600 lbs and under; 05 percent cows and bulls with 175 early.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - (Figures in parentheses are weighted average prices) Medium and Large 1 550-600 lbs 87.00-93.00 (90.95); 650-700 lbs 75.35-80.00 (78.17); 700-750 lbs 73.75-78.50 (75.75); 750-800 lbs 70.25-76.00 (73.26); 800-850 lbs 70.00-75.00 (72.59); 850-900 lbs 67.25-69.80 (68.21); 900-950 lbs 66.75-70.75 (68.21); 8 head 1020 lbs 62.50. Steers and bulls 400-450 lbs 74.00-86.00 (82.44); 18 head 458 lbs 89.00. Medium and Large 1-2 700-750 lbs 69.75-71.75 (71.02); 36 head 782 lbs 69.75. Steers and bulls 16 head 364 lbs 89.00.</p>
<p>Medium 1 650-700 lbs 64.00-73.50 (70.13).</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers Medium and Large 1 550-600 lbs 74.50-83.00 (80.39); 600-650 lbs 73.00-76.50 (74.50); 650-700 lbs 70.00- 73.00 (72.30), 58 head Exotic x 658 lbs 76.85; 700-750 lbs 68.50-73.25 (71.74); 750-800 lbs 67.00-72.00 (70.55); 800-850 lbs 66.25-67.75 (66.46). Full and/or fleshy 23 head 745 lbs 65.50. Medium and Large 1-2 550-600 lbs 70.00-74.00 (72.18); 30 head 620 lbs 71.75; 650-700 lbs 62.25-67.75 (66.30); 40 head 743 lbs 67.00; 19 head 781 lbs 63.25. Medium 1 15 head 638 lbs 69.00.</p>
<p>Receipts - 3,664   Last Week - 6,414   Last Year - 3,354</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
